NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.Content: "I feel pretty fine right now."
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.NoHome: "I would very much like a house, all the colorful monsters scare me."
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.FarFromHome: "Could you please get me back to my house?"
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.LoveSpace: "I love how there is so much space here to code tModLoader mods!"
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.DislikeCrowded: "There are too many people around, it makes it hard for me to focus on mod making."
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.HateCrowded: "I can't test my mod with so many people around!"
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.LoveBiome: "I love {BiomeName}."
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.LikeBiome: "{BiomeName} is a very nice place to test mods in."
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.DislikeBiome: "It's way too cold in {BiomeName}, I'm freezing!"
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.HateBiome: "It's kind of hard to mod while being attacked by monsters in {BiomeName}."
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.LoveNPC: "Do you think {NPCName} notices me?"
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.LikeNPC: "I can respect {NPCName} as a fellow guide and educator!"
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.DislikeNPC: "{NPCName} is not very helpful."
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.HateNPC: "I hate all the loud noises caused by {NPCName} and his explosives! I just want peace and quiet."
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.LikeNPC_Princess: "{NPCName} is a princess? That is so cool!"
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} is so square. I love that about them!"
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.LikeNPC_BestiaryGirl: "{NPCName} likes to research animals the same way I like to research mods."
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.DislikeNPC_Merchant: "{NPCName} keeps rambling on about \"paid mods\"... Wish I could convince him how terrible of an idea that is."
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.DislikeBiome_Desert: "It's way too hot in {BiomeName}, I'm burning!"
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.LoveBiome_ExampleMod/ExampleSurfaceBiome: "{BiomeName} makes me feel right at home!"
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.Guide_LovesNPC: "I love a fellow educator like {NPCName}."
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.BestiaryGirl_LikesNPC: "I like the research {NPCName} does."
NPCs.ExamplePerson.TownNPCMood.Transformed.BestiaryGirl_LikesNPC: "{NPCName} research GOOD!"
NPCs.ExamplePerson.Interactions.AwesomeifyButton: "Awesomeify"
NPCs.ExamplePerson.Interactions.AwesomeifyResponse: "Awesome!"
