Bestiary.ImportantFlavorText: "Important Flavor Text!"
Bestiary.ExampleBoneMerchant_1: "Hailing from a mysterious greyscale cube world, the Example Bone Merchant will show you how to make a mysterious merchant underground with tModLoader."
Bestiary.ExampleBoneMerchant_2: "Built with bone blocks and arms of steel. Throws bones day and night."
Bestiary.ExampleTownPet: "A blocky Town Pet to bring extra cuteness to the town."
Bestiary.MinionBossBody: "Example Minion Boss that spawns minions on spawn, summoned with a spawn item. Showcases boss minion handling, multiplayer considerations, and custom boss bar."
Bestiary.ExampleCritterNPC: "The most adorable goodest spicy child. Do not dare be mean to him!"
Bestiary.ExampleZombieThief: "This type of zombie really like Example Items. They steal them as soon as they find some."
Bestiary.MinionBossMinion: "A minion protecting his boss from taking damage by sacrificing itself. If none are alive, the boss is exposed to damage."
Bestiary.ExampleWormHead: "Looks like a Digger fell into some aqua-colored paint. Oh well."
Dialogue.ExamplePerson.PartyGirlDialogue: "Can you please tell {PartyGirl} to stop decorating my house with colors?"
Dialogue.ExamplePerson.StandardDialogue4: "Hey, if you find a [i:HiveBackpack], I can upgrade it for you."
Dialogue.ExamplePerson.ConditionalDialogue1: "{?ExampleMod/DownedMinionBoss}{?GolemDefeated}Wow, you defeated both {$NPCs.MinionBossBody.DisplayName} and {$NPCName.Golem}? Amazing!"
Dialogue.ExamplePerson.ConditionalDialogue2: "{?!Day}{?!NPCFirstName_ExampleMod/ExampleTownPet}It's scary at night. I'd feel a lot safer if I had a pet to keep me company."
Dialogue.ExamplePerson.CommonDialogue: "This message has a weight of 5, meaning it appears 5 times more often."
Dialogue.ExamplePerson.RareDialogue: "This message has a weight of 0.1, meaning it appears 10 times as rare."
Dialogue.ExampleBoneMerchant.StandardDialogue1: "It's relaxing down here in the underground."
Dialogue.ExampleBoneMerchant.StandardDialogue2: "What am I doing down here you may ask? I'm not sure, but leave me be!"
Dialogue.ExampleBoneMerchant.StandardDialogue3: "Huh? What wares do I have? I have no idea! How about you ask?"
Dialogue.ExampleTravelingMerchant.PartyGirlDialogue: "Can you please tell {PartyGirl} to stop decorating my cousin's house with colors?"
Dialogue.ExampleTravelingMerchant.StandardDialogue1: "Sometimes my cousin feels like they're different from everyone else here."
Dialogue.ExampleTravelingMerchant.StandardDialogue2: "What's your favorite color? My cousin's favorite colors are white and black."
Dialogue.ExampleTravelingMerchant.StandardDialogue3: "I'm a traveling merchant, and I sell things."
Dialogue.ExampleTravelingMerchant.ConditionalDialogue1: "Is that my cousin {NPCFirstName_ExampleMod/ExamplePerson} over there?"
Dialogue.ExampleTravelingMerchant.HiveBackpackDialogue: "Hey, if you find a [i:HiveBackpack], my cousin can upgrade it for you."
Dialogue.ExampleTownPet.StandardDialogue: "*Example Town Pet noises*"
